    "rules_text": "When you succeed on an attack roll against a target, you can mark a Stress to Brand them until you take a long rest or cast this spell again. You always know the direction of the Branded target. If the Branded target deals damage to you, you can remove the Branded condition to make them mark 2 Stress.",
